flowchart LR
    Data[(Copy task and text)] --> Embed[Token and position embeddings]
    Embed --> Attn[Causal self-attention]
    Attn --> FFN[GELU feed-forward]
    FFN --> Head[Tied output head]
    Head --> Loss[Cross-entropy loss]
    Loss --> Backward[Reverse-mode autodiff]
    Backward --> Adam[Adam optimizer]
    Adam -.->|updated weights| Embed
    Client([Client]) --> Router[HTTP router]
    Router --> Embed
